    "2. Solve backward to find feasible input values. For deterministic code, derive exact values.\n"
    "   For stochastic code (random), choose specific values and note that any valid configuration works.\n"
    "3. Verify internally: if I run main_solution with these inputs, will I get the target output?\n"
    "4. For numerical tasks, compute values precisely and preserve full float precision.\n\n"
